    "text": "Our department consists of two key teams:\n\nModeling Team: Focused on epidemiological surveillance and outbreak forecasting, this team requires a solid understanding of epidemiology as well as proficiency in R programming for data analysis and modeling.\nEOC Team: Responsible for ensuring rapid preparedness and effective response to public health emergencies, this team focuses on planning, coordination, and operational readiness during outbreaks.\n\nWe welcome you to connect for more projects. 💪\n\n\n    \n    \n        \n        \n            Lan Truong\n            Position: Head of Department of Surveillance, Warning and Preparedness, Emergency Response\n            Major: Master of Public Health\n        \n    \n\n    \n    \n        \n        An Tran\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        Modeling team\n    \n    \n    \n        \n        Anh Huynh\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        Modeling team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Diem Le\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        Modeling team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Thu Pham\n        Major: Bachelor of Public Health\n        Modeling team\n    \n\n    \n    \n        \n        Khang Huynh\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        EOC team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Vy Tran\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        EOC team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Ngoc Dinh\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        EOC team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Le Tran\n        Major: Bachelor of Public Health\n        EOC team\n    \n    \n    \n    \n        \n        Tuyen Pham\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        EOC team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Quan Truong\n        Major: Doctor of Preventive Medicine\n        Modeling team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Vinh Tran\n        Major: Bachelor of Public Health\n        Modeling team\n    \n\n    \n        \n        Nhon Nguyen\n    